      "requestAttempts": 1,
      "pronunciationText": "It's testable, and it could even be shown wrong, if the mass didn't change. But it gives no amount, so it isn't specific enough for our question. It also gives no reason. Our hypothesis passes all four checks, because a result of twenty-five percent would clearly show it's wrong.",
